<title>INDIA: Indian January car, two-wheeler production rises.</title>
<headline>Indian January car, two-wheeler production rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian production of cars and two-wheelers rose in January compared to the same month in 1996, the Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers (AIAM) said in a monthly statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				   PRODUCTION (in units)</p>
<p>		  Jan 97  Dec 96  Jan 96  Apr96-Jan97  Apr95-Jan96</p>
<p>  CARS	  38,526  39,224  32,033    332,673	278,044</p>
<p>  2-WHEELERS 235,237 261,363 211,053  2,492,341    2,145,842</p>
<p>				     SALES (in units)</p>
<p>		  Jan 97  Dec 96  Jan 96  Apr96-Jan97  Apr95-Jan96</p>
<p>  CARS	  39,672  35,826  30,711     325,419	271,819</p>
<p>  2-WHEELERS 246,835 234,424 219,039   2,442,294    2,153,329</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301-2024</p>
</text>
